   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC Climate 2009-2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MRC Climate 2009-2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CCAI m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttning &#xe4;r att klimatanpassningsplanering och genomf&#xf6;rande styrs av f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade strategier och planer p&#xe5; olika niv&#xe5;er och i f&#xf6;rsta hand platser &#xf6;ver hela Lower Mekong Basin. Finansieringen fokuserar p&#xe5; etablering av partnerskap, piloter och  demonstrationsprojekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCAI&apos;s objective is that climate change adaptation planning and implementation is guided by improved strategies and plans at various levels and in priority locations throughout the Lower Mekong Basin. The &quot;intermediate phase&quot; 2009-2010 that Sida is hereby funding is focussed on general inception and establishment of partnerships, pilots and demonstrations.</narrative>
  </description>
